{"id":"n73246-1-9","stage":1,"title":"횡단보도 · 人行横道","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73246-1-9-1","ko":"실례합니다만, 여기에서 우체국까지 어떻게 가죠?","zh":"打扰一下，从这里去邮局该怎么走呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"실례합니다만,","meaning":"不礼貌，失礼，失敬","explanation":"실례하다：不礼貌，失礼，失敬；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"실례하다","audio":"/audio/bc6c832cab8fe19f0944.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66284","senseId":"1","lemma":"실례하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우체국까지","meaning":"邮局","explanation":"우체국：邮局；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"우체국","audio":"/audio/849e8b72fa03e3c90dcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31486","senseId":"1","lemma":"우체국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가죠?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bc6c832cab8fe19f","term":"실례하다","zh":"不礼貌，失礼，失敬","audio":"/audio/bc6c832cab8fe19f0944.mp3","entryId":"66284","definition":"言行有违礼仪。","pronunciation":["실례하다"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"849e8b72fa03e3c9","term":"우체국","zh":"邮局","audio":"/audio/849e8b72fa03e3c90dcb.mp3","entryId":"31486","definition":"负责邮寄信件、包裹或管理存款等的公共机关。","pronunciation":["우체국"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/be0153ce5fde73f7e907.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73246-1-9-2","ko":"저 앞 사거리에서 횡단보도를 건너면 오른쪽에 있습니다.","zh":"在前面那个十字路口过人行横道后，就在右边。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사거리에서","meaning":"十字路口","explanation":"사거리：十字路口；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사거리","audio":"/audio/9c9e79138d8d4fe75dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88600","senseId":"1","lemma":"사거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"횡단보도를","meaning":"人行横道，斑马线","explanation":"횡단보도：人行横道，斑马线；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"횡단보도","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73246","senseId":"1","lemma":"횡단보도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건너면","meaning":"过，跨过，渡过","explanation":"건너다：过，跨过，渡过；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"건너다","audio":"/audio/07eea3489942d9d94543.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53853","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오른쪽에","meaning":"右侧，右边","explanation":"오른쪽：右侧，右边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17252","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다：在；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"9c9e79138d8d4fe7","term":"사거리","zh":"十字路口","audio":"/audio/9c9e79138d8d4fe75dee.mp3","entryId":"88600","definition":"道路被分成四个方向的地方。","pronunciation":["사ː거리"]},{"id":"1be9bc555fce2a50","term":"횡단보도","zh":"人行横道，斑马线","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3","entryId":"73246","definition":"车道上标示出来的供行人横向穿过的路。","pronunciation":["횡단보도","휑단보도"]},{"id":"07eea3489942d9d9","term":"건너다","zh":"过，跨过，渡过","audio":"/audio/07eea3489942d9d94543.mp3","entryId":"53853","definition":"越过或经过某物，移动到对面。","pronunciation":["건ː너다"]},{"id":"f594aa6a15b9381c","term":"오른쪽","zh":"右侧，右边","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3","entryId":"17252","definition":"人面向北边时和东边相同的一侧。","pronunciation":["오른쪽"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"某物占有某处位置或空间。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ee521a41970f529bf1e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.845,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73246","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.3971,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在前面那个十字路口过人行横道后，就在右边。","你过来，把猪肉切成小块吧。","打扰一下，从这里去邮局该怎么走呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在前面那个十字路口过人行横道后，就在右边。","打扰一下，从这里去邮局该怎么走呢？","你过来，把猪肉切成小块吧。"],"answer":0}]}
